  "description": "The Smok Stick N18 Replacement Tank is a versatile and compact 2ml tank designed to deliver a smooth and satisfying vaping experience. Featuring a user-friendly top-fill system and side-viewing ports, this tank makes monitoring and refilling e-liquid simple and mess-free. The slim, comfortable drip tip enhances the vaping experience, while an adjustable airflow ring at the base allows you to fine-tune your draw for optimal flavour and vapour production. The N18 Tank is compatible with Smok’s popular Nord coil series, offering a range of resistances to suit different vaping preferences. The pre-installed Nord 0.6Ω mesh coil is ideal for a direct-lung (DL) experience with robust flavour and vapour, while the optional Nord 1.4Ω regular coil delivers a satisfying mouth-to-lung (MTL) vape. Perfectly suited for use with high-PG, 50/50, and nicotine salt e-liquids, the N18 Tank is a reliable choice for vapers seeking customisation and convenience. Designed for use with the Smok Stick N18 kit, this replacement tank combines sleek design, reliable performance, and compatibility with one of Smok’s most trusted coil ranges.",
